 "paragraph_overrides": {
  "10": "But he also alluded to the strange grief that many mathematicians have felt watching AI vacuum up their most treasured problems. He said the timing of the release of the solution, which he said he produced Sunday, had nothing to do with Anthropic’s record-breaking foray into the stock market. “The precise timing is horrible. If I could have, I’d have finished this all much earlier,” he wrote. “Hell, strictly before this age would have sure been nice.”"
